{"meta":{"id":"modularity","category":"aide/common-rules","title":"모듈화","subtitle":"(컴포넌트 경계 원칙)","summary":"컴포넌트 경계 원칙 — 기능 단위로 모듈(여러 class) 구성","tags":["aide","규칙","모듈화"],"color":"indigo","watermarkClass":"watermark-bg-linux-commands","updatedAt":"2026-09-05"},"html":"<div class=\"absolute -top-12 -right-12 w-48 h-48 bg-indigo-100/70 rounded-full blur-3xl opacity-60 pointer-events-none\"></div>\n<div class=\"absolute -bottom-16 -left-16 w-48 h-48 bg-indigo-50/80 rounded-full blur-2xl opacity-80 pointer-events-none\"></div>\n\n<div class=\"relative pb-5 border-b border-indigo-100/80\">\n  <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-2.5\">\n    <span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-indigo-50 text-indigo-600 border border-indigo-200/50 tracking-wider\">\n      <span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-indigo-500\"></span>\n      1-rules\n    </span>\n    <span class=\"text-[11px] font-medium tracking-wide uppercase text-stone-400 font-serif\">aide Common Rules</span>\n  </div>\n\n  <h1 class=\"text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-tight leading-snug\">\n    모듈화 <span class=\"text-base sm:text-lg font-normal text-indigo-400 font-serif\">(컴포넌트 경계 원칙)</span>\n  </h1>\n\n  <div class=\"mt-3 flex items-start gap-2 bg-indigo-50/50 border border-indigo-100/70 rounded-xl p-3\">\n    <svg class=\"w-4 h-4 text-indigo-400 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\">\n      <path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path>\n    </svg>\n    <p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-700 leading-relaxed font-medium\">\n      <strong class=\"text-stone-900\">적용 범위:</strong> 백엔드/프론트 공통, 규모(테스트~대규모)와 무관하게 적용\n    </p>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"py-5 border-b border-stone-100\">\n  <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\">\n    <div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-indigo-500\"></div>\n    <h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide uppercase\">규칙</h2>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"space-y-2 text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 pl-1\">\n    <div class=\"tip-bullet-row\">\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-indigo-400\">•</span>\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-content\"><strong class=\"font-bold text-stone-900\">기능 단위:</strong> 하나의 기능을 한 모듈(여러 class)로 생성 가능해야 한다</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"tip-bullet-row\">\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-indigo-400\">•</span>\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">모듈 하나는 entry-point(라우터/컨트롤러) + logic(서비스) + data-access(레포지토리) 등 <strong class=\"font-bold text-stone-900\">여러 class로 구성될 수 있다</strong> — 클래스 하나가 아니라 \"기능을 이루는 클래스 묶음\"이 모듈이다</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"tip-bullet-row\">\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-indigo-400\">•</span>\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">모듈은 <strong class=\"font-bold text-stone-900\">독립적으로 추가/삭제/교체 가능</strong>해야 한다 — 한 모듈을 지워도 다른 모듈이 깨지지 않아야 한다</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"tip-bullet-row\">\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-indigo-400\">•</span>\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">모듈 간 직접 참조는 피한다. 공유가 필요하면 명시적인 공통 영역(<code class=\"text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded\">common/</code>, <code class=\"text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded\">shared/</code>)을 통해서만 연결한다</span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"py-5\">\n  <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-3\">\n    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n      <div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-indigo-500\"></div>\n      <h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide uppercase\">왜</h2>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">\n    기능을 \"여러 class로 구성된 모듈\"로 보면, 규모가 커져도(중규모/대규모) 같은 원칙을 그대로 반복 적용할 수 있다 — 도메인 우선 구조든 features 기반 구조든, 결국 \"기능 = 모듈 = 여러 class 묶음\"이라는 이 원칙을 규모별로 구체화한 것뿐이다.\n  </p>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"mt-2 bg-stone-50 border border-stone-200/80 rounded-2xl p-4 sm:p-4.5\">\n  <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-2.5\">\n    <svg class=\"w-4 h-4 text-indigo-500\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n      <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M9 12l2 2 4-4m6 2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z\"></path>\n    </svg>\n    <h3 class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold text-stone-900\">체크리스트</h3>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"space-y-2 text-stone-600 pl-1\">\n    <div class=\"tip-bullet-row\">\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-indigo-500\">•</span>\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">모듈 하나를 삭제해도 다른 모듈이 안 깨지는가</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"tip-bullet-row\">\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-indigo-500\">•</span>\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">모듈 내부에 클래스가 역할별로 나뉘어 있는가(진입점/로직/데이터 접근)</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"tip-bullet-row\">\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-indigo-500\">•</span>\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">모듈 간 의존이 필요하면 공통 영역을 통해서만 연결되는가</span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"mt-5 pt-3 border-t border-stone-100 flex items-center justify-between text-[11px] text-stone-400\">\n  <span>aide Common Rules</span>\n  <span>모듈화</span>\n</div>\n","path":"aide/common-rules/modularity","breadcrumb":[{"id":"root","title":"Home","path":""},{"id":"aide","title":"aide","path":"aide"},{"id":"common-rules","title":"1-rules (공통 규칙)","path":"aide/common-rules"}],"hasImage":false}